    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/rainy",
      "key": "Evelyn",
      "field": null,
      "source": "When I woke up I heard dripping from somewhere... I think the roof might be leaking.$s#$e#In the old days, George would've scampered right up and fixed it... *sigh*$s",
      "translation": "Když jsem se probudila, slyšela jsem odněkud kapat vodu... Asi nám zatéká střechou.$s#$e#Kdysi by George hned vyběhl nahoru a opravil ji... *povzdechne si*$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "868dd11cbfb10339d7b977fedc2749e7d685234babf78423f0ef7c320fd7b25b",
      "translationSHA256": "940f6e1bf8ffc63cd68b233aa68442efcabfac956ad416119ca86244d86de26c",
      "reviewChecks": [
