    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/rainy",
      "key": "Haley",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I spent all morning doing my hair... now the rain could mess it up.$s#$e#*sigh* ... Life is hard sometimes.",
      "translation": "Celé ráno jsem si upravovala vlasy... a teď mi je déšť může zničit.$s#$e#*povzdechne si*... Život je někdy těžký.",
      "sourceSHA256": "cd761b07f96e55d9386b709a47249d551965c49766c41949e3f589d393ab5864",
      "translationSHA256": "73a0b44159ffc8116e64fe25a7568dafffefd1f794421472298af6d47a39f2bb",
      "reviewChecks": [
